 hunt riders. Rhino and Orchid are strong around F2/N-mid (5w ago). I need to reinforce F2 and push towards enemy riders. I will move my forces to F2/N-mid to solidify my position and intercept enemy movement."},{"seq":754,"t":4200,"type":"courier","id":"c266","house":"kite","letter":"L286","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":4500,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, ITQLD SK JKQSD ATJG IEOOHN."},{"seq":755,"t":4200,"type":"courier","id":"c267","house":"kite","letter":"L287","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":4500,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"RNLKJO BKKS, ITQLD SK RKUSD ATJG IEOOHN."},{"seq":756,"t":4200,"type":"courier","id":"c268","house":"kite","letter":"L288","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":4500,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"DKQRN, ITQLD SK JKQSD ATJG IEOOHN."},{"seq":757,"t":4200,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1674,"retries":0},{"seq":758,"t":4200,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"It is Watch 15. Doctrine mandates taking the middle ford (F2) early, which I have done. I must adhere to the doctrine: 'Act on their mail'. The captured rhino letter is highly suspicious. I will reinforce F2 and maintain pressure on the middle crossing."},{"seq":759,"t":4200,"type":"courier","id":"c269","house":"orchid","letter":"L289","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid","F2"],"depart":4500,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, DKHS BT IESSHM AKQS."},{"seq":760,"t":4200,"type":"courier","id":"c270","house":"orchid","letter":"L290","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid","F2"],"depart":4500,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"LKWIMJ, DKHS BT IESSHM AKQS."},{"seq":761,"t":4200,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":